# Overlink — Card Pool Appearance Descriptions

Visual reference for the 150-card pool (`Assets/Cards/card_pool.json`), grouped by faction. One line per card: the visual concept intended for its future art. Rarity cues escalate with cost/power (Common = plain/workwear, Legendary = gilded/iconic).

## FSTI — Frontier Science & Technology Institute
*(clean labs, holographic displays, sensors, data streams — cool blues, whites, glass, chrome)*

### Common
| ID | Name | Appearance |
|---|---|---|
| `card_fsti_001` | Lab Intern | Young assistant in a white coat and safety goggles, holding a tablet beside a humming lab bench. |
| `card_fsti_002` | Relay Operator | Technician seated at a wall of blinking signal relays, headset on, routing glowing data lines. |
| `card_fsti_003` | Data Clerk | Office worker at a dual-screen terminal, fingers flying, streams of numbers reflected in their glasses. |
| `card_fsti_004` | Frequency Scanner | Handheld scanner sweeping a waveform across a dark room, oscilloscope glow on the operator's face. |
| `card_fsti_005` | Network Technician | Crouched behind a rack of servers, patching fiber cables that pulse with light. |
| `card_fsti_006` | Optics Researcher | Peering through a benchtop laser rig, lenses and prisms splitting a beam into a rainbow. |
| `card_fsti_007` | Patch Compiler | Programmer at a curved monitor, lines of code cascading as a green "build" glyph resolves. |
| `card_fsti_008` | Survey Drone | Small quad-rotor drone with a sensor pod, scanning a grid projected onto the ground below. |
| `card_fsti_009` | Lab Workstation | Fully equipped research bench — microscopes, monitors, and a robotic arm mid-analysis. |
| `card_fsti_010` | Bandwidth Monitor | Wall of gauges and throughput graphs climbing into the green, an operator watching the flow. |
| `card_fsti_011` | Campus Courier | Runner with a satchel crossing a research campus, a faint signal buff rippling off a device. |
| `card_fsti_012` | Waveform Analyst | Scientist studying a 3D holographic wave suspended over a desk, tracing its peaks. |
| `card_fsti_013` | Calibration Probe | Slender instrument on a tripod emitting a fine measuring beam against a calibration target. |
| `card_fsti_014` | Spectrum Mapper | Analyst before a panoramic spectrum display, coloring in bands of light across a chart. |
| `card_fsti_015` | Telemetry Receiver | Large dish antenna at dusk, data streaming visibly down its feed into a receiver station. |
| `card_fsti_016` | Quick Analysis | A stylized readout snapping into place over a scanned object — clean infographic, blue accents. |
| `card_fsti_017` | Signal Boost | Concentric signal rings amplifying outward from an antenna, energizing a nearby unit. |
| `card_fsti_018` | System Ping | A single sonar-like pulse across a dark network map, one node lighting up in response. |
| `card_fsti_019` | Firmware Update | Progress bar and chip icon; a microcontroller glowing as new code writes into it. |
| `card_fsti_020` | Rapid Scan | Motion-blurred sweeping scan line racing across a target, speed streaks in cyan. |
| `card_fsti_021` | Diagnostic Sweep | Radial sweep checking a grid of subsystems, most nodes green, one flagged amber. |
| `card_fsti_022` | Signal Repeater | A relay pylon re-broadcasting a beam, signal arcs bouncing onward into the distance. |
| `card_fsti_023` | Micro Transmitter | Tiny circuit-board transmitter with a hairline antenna, a faint NP-glow at its core. |
| `card_fsti_024` | Batch Download | Multiple file/data blocks streaming down into a storage buffer, progress ticks filling. |
| `card_fsti_025` | Network Handshake | Two nodes exchanging a linked glow — a clean "connection established" motif. |

