| `card_fsti_050` | Nexus Core | A vast crystalline processing core, the hub of all FSTI networks, radiating draw, power, and command. |

## FRTI — Frontier Research & Technology Institute
*(heavy industry, forge and steel, machinery, combustion — hot oranges, iron greys, sparks, rivets)*

### Common
| ID | Name | Appearance |
|---|---|---|
| `card_frti_001` | Assembly Worker | Factory hand at a conveyor, fitting parts onto a chassis, gloves and apron, sparks nearby. |
| `card_frti_002` | Rivet Gunner | Worker wielding a pneumatic rivet gun, driving fasteners into a steel plate with a burst of air. |
| `card_frti_003` | Frame Hauler | Loader carrying a heavy metal frame across the factory floor, hydraulics straining. |
| `card_frti_004` | Welding Apprentice | Trainee behind a welding mask, a bright arc fusing two beams, shower of sparks. |
| `card_frti_005` | Piston Driver | Machine operator at a rhythmic piston press, mechanical arms stamping in time. |
| `card_frti_006` | Conveyor Operator | Worker overseeing a moving belt of components, adjusting flow at a control panel. |
| `card_frti_007` | Crane Rigger | Operator high in a gantry crane, hooking and swinging a massive load into place. |
| `card_frti_008` | Foundry Stoker | Laborer feeding a roaring furnace, molten glow lighting a soot-streaked face. |
| `card_frti_009` | Impact Hammer | A huge drop-hammer mid-swing, poised to strike first and hardest, weight and momentum. |
| `card_frti_010` | Drill Sergeant | Hardened foreman with a tool-belt, barking orders that visibly sharpen a nearby unit. |
| `card_frti_011` | Load Bearer | Sturdy worker hauling a heavy crate on a shoulder rig, steady and unyielding. |
| `card_frti_012` | Turbine Mechanic | Engineer servicing a spinning turbine, blades blurring, high output and high risk. |
| `card_frti_013` | Scrap Collector | Scavenger with a magnetic grapnel, gathering loose metal that converts to NP. |
| `card_frti_014` | Boiler Guard | Watchman beside a pressure boiler, gauge climbing, thick-plated and imposing. |
| `card_frti_015` | Junction Welder | Welder at a pipe junction, a small quick arc — free to deploy, modest build. |
| `card_frti_016` | Overclock Engine | An engine pushed past its redline, glowing hot, power surging into a connected unit. |
| `card_frti_017` | Reinforced Plating | Steel plates being bolted over a frame, a shield layer clamping into place. |
| `card_frti_018` | Heavy Swing | A massive wrench/beam mid-arc, kinetic impact lines aimed at a target. |
| `card_frti_019` | Industrial Surge | A sudden burst of factory power channeled into one unit, energy arcs around it. |
| `card_frti_020` | Quick Weld | A fast, bright spot-weld flaring instantly — speed emphasized, minimal buildup. |
| `card_frti_021` | Controlled Demolition | Precisely rigged charges collapsing a structure, shockwave hitting all nearby foes. |
| `card_frti_022` | Supply Depot | A warehouse of crates and fuel drums, a permanent reinforcement line feeding the front. |
| `card_frti_023` | Ore Processor | Crushing and refining raw ore into usable energy, conveyor and grinder, NP output. |
| `card_frti_024` | Production Line | An assembly line in motion, each station adding strength to what rolls off the end. |
| `card_frti_025` | Shift Change | Workers swapping at the factory gate, steady output continuing turn after turn. |

