| `card_frti_049` | Grand Forge | The institute's legendary mega-forge, a cathedral of industry permanently empowering all and scorching foes. |
| `card_frti_050` | Total Collapse | A full structural failure unleashed — the entire factory coming down on every enemy at maximum cost. |

## FPB — Frontier Planning Bureau
*(drafting studios, blueprints, conservation and restoration, galleries — warm paper tones, ink, gilt, protective coatings)*

### Common
| ID | Name | Appearance |
|---|---|---|
| `card_fpb_001` | Junior Drafter | Trainee at a drafting table with T-square and pencils, sketching a first careful layout. |
| `card_fpb_002` | Blueprint Archivist | Clerk among rolled blueprints and flat files, cataloging plans in a tidy archive. |
| `card_fpb_003` | Sketch Apprentice | Student sketching on a pad, a light protective wash already forming over the page. |
| `card_fpb_004` | Layout Planner | Planner arranging blocks on a drafting board, a faint shield grid over the composition. |
| `card_fpb_005` | Site Surveyor | Surveyor with a theodolite on site, taking readings that mend a nearby structure. |
| `card_fpb_006` | Zoning Inspector | Official with a clipboard checking a plan against code, stamp of approval in hand. |
| `card_fpb_007` | Perspective Artist | Artist drawing vanishing-point lines on a canvas, a fine varnish shielding the work. |
| `card_fpb_008` | Foundation Layer | Worker setting a solid base layer, broad and sturdy, built to hold. |
| `card_fpb_009` | Model Maker | Craftsman assembling a scale model, repairing a cracked piece back to strength. |
| `card_fpb_010` | Color Theorist | Painter mixing pigments, applying a protective color theory to a neighboring work. |
| `card_fpb_011` | Render Technician | Artist at a render station, a coated finish glazing over the output. |
| `card_fpb_012` | Structural Engineer | Engineer reviewing load diagrams, robust and reliable, the backbone of a build. |
| `card_fpb_013` | Eraser | A simple rubber eraser lifting away error — tiny, free, a humble blocker. |
| `card_fpb_014` | Detail Renderer | Fine-detail artist adding finishing touches that restore an adjacent piece. |
| `card_fpb_015` | Scale Modeller | Modeler working a precise scaled replica, sharp and quick. |
| `card_fpb_016` | Quick Sketch | A rapid loose sketch that throws a quick protective shield over an ally. |
| `card_fpb_017` | Patch Work | Hands mending a torn drawing with careful patches, health restored. |
| `card_fpb_018` | Revised Draft | A clean second draft laid over the first, mending flaws across the whole team. |
| `card_fpb_019` | Protective Coating | A clear protective layer brushed quickly over a surface, sealing it fast. |
| `card_fpb_020` | Foundation Check | A quick inspection tick that patches a small fault — free, minor heal. |
| `card_fpb_021` | Clear Coat | A fine lacquer sprayed evenly, a light shield settling over all allied works. |
| `card_fpb_022` | Restoration Studio | A workbench of brushes and solvents, continually restoring a piece on demand. |
| `card_fpb_023` | Material Stockpile | Shelves of conservation materials, ready to supply a protective layer when called. |
| `card_fpb_024` | Maintenance Schedule | A pinned timetable of upkeep tasks, steadily healing the team every turn. |
| `card_fpb_025` | Iterative Design | A sequence of evolving drafts stacked, each cycle adding a protective refinement. |

